{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109207","id":2714107605,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6hxf7V","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109207","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109207.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109207.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109207","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109207/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109207/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109207/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/66617b284bbb808581ff1bf7266a77bf05771f92","number":109207,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make the behavior of `rendering/rendering_device/driver` consistent with `--rendering-driver`","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, the `--rendering-device` command supports direct switching between `d3d12`, `vulkan`, and `opengl3`, among others. Although the `rendering/rendering_device/driver` setting in the configuration file can also be set to `opengl3`, doing so may cause rendering bugs in child windows:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"图片\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88955824-0aea-4f0e-b8fd-da0f2b4566d6\" />\r\nThrough examining the source code, I discovered that this occurs because when reading `--rendering-device`, if `rendering_driver` is set to `opengl3`, it automatically sets `rendering_method` to `gl_compatibility`. However, reading from the configuration file does not trigger this behavior, so I added it manually.\r\nThis is not the conventional usage of `rendering/rendering_device/driver`, but I'd like to allow users to switch rendering APIs via `override.cfg` in my project. Whether it's `d3d12`, `vulkan`, or `opengl3`, different users have reported rendering issues with each. Previously, users could only switch APIs using `--rendering-device`, which wasn't very convenient. Enabling `rendering/rendering_device/driver` to be properly set to `opengl3` would be much more user-friendly (sparing users the need to simultaneously change both `rendering/renderer/rendering_method` and `rendering/rendering_device/driver`).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-01T19:18:56Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T11:55:59Z","closed_at":"2025-11-27T11:53:20Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0357b87b3d70e0668d2a11403ec3fc2ed5713fa1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"scgm0:Fix-RenderingDevice-Opengl3","ref":"Fix-RenderingDevice-Opengl3","repo":{"id":714732650,"node_id":"R_kgDOKpn0ag","name":"godot","full_name":"scgm0/godot","owner":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":"C++","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":0,"open_issues":0,"size":1